# Frontend Environment Variables
#
# Leave this UNSET for the default deployment. The API server serves the built
# client from the same origin, so the app calls "/api" on its own URL (both in
# production and through the Vite dev proxy locally). Nothing to configure here.
#
# Set it ONLY when the client is hosted on a DIFFERENT origin than the API,
# e.g. client on Vercel + API on Railway:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.up.railway.app
#
# (Never use http://localhost:3001 here — that address only exists on the machine
# running the server and would break every deployed browser.)
